Description: Remove content/browser/tracing:resources from chrome_paks.gni
 Chromium 145.0.7632.109 no longer has content/browser/tracing/BUILD.gn but
 chrome/chrome_paks.gni still references //content/browser/tracing:resources.
 The Debian catapult.patch normally handles this removal but its context no
 longer matches due to the addition of webui_toolbar:resources in .109.
 .
 This is the same tracing removal that CEF patch 0021 does for cef/BUILD.gn
 but applied to the Chromium side (chrome/chrome_paks.gni).
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-02-20

diff --git a/chrome/chrome_paks.gni b/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
index 493ba19..475719d 100644
--- a/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
+++ b/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
@@ -264,7 +264,6 @@ template("chrome_extra_paks") {
         "//chrome/browser/resources/side_panel/comments:resources",
         "//chrome/browser/resources/tab_group_home:resources",
         "//chrome/browser/resources/webui_toolbar:resources",
-        "//content/browser/tracing:resources",
       ]
       if (is_chrome_branded) {
         sources += [
